{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny: is a first-person platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to reach the top and achieve a good speedrun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple mechanic, simple controls, and quick restarts, Tiny: delivers a platforming challenge for players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a speedrunner chasing the perfect time or a casual gamer looking for a simple game you may find &quot;Tiny&quot; a good choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a single-player game, Tiny: mixed between simplicity and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny: has a pure focus on platforming jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keywords:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming,Jumping,SimplePlatformer,IndiePlatformer,Indie,3DPlatformer,PrecisionPlatformer,PrecisionJumps,JumpingUp,ClimbUp,OnlyClimb,LittleJump,LittlePlatformer,TinyOnlyUp,TinyJump,TinyPrecision,TinyGame,ReachTheTop,ReachUp,PCPlatformer,TinyPlatformer, ,</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926680?t=1772153168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926680/66c28779b6383a23b1ace1122fdb7c83079327d3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772153168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926680/d2ba59932260890fa548d2f7acecc623cb80cc3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772153168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926680/d2ba59932260890fa548d2f7acecc623cb80cc3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772153168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_de